============SQL
SQL IS THE UNIVERSAL LANGUAGE FOR WORKING WITH DATABASES.
IT LET YOU STORE, RETRIEVE, UPDATE AND DELETE DATA IN A STRUCTURED WAY.
SQL STANDS FOR STRUCTURED QUERY LANGUAGE
IT IS THE STANDARD LANGUAGE FOR INTERACTING WITH RELATIONAL DATABASES
SQL COMMANDS LET YOU CREATE, READ, UPDATE AND DELETE CRUD DATA EFFICIENTLY.

============DATABASE
DATABASE IS AN ORGANIZED COLLECTION OF DATA.

============DBMS
DATABASE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
SOFTWARE THAT MANAGES DATABASES, ENSURING DATA INTEGRITY, SECURITY, BACKUPS, AND MULTI-USER ACCESS.
EXAMPLE: MYSQL, POSTGRESQL, ORACLE, SQL SERVER, SQLITE

============TYPES OF DATABASE
RELATIONAL RDMS= TABLES WITH ROWS AND COLUMNS, RELATIONSHIPS BETWEEN THEM LIKE MYSQL, ORACLE
NON RELATIONAL NOSQL = FLEXIBLE, SCHEMALESS LIKE MONGODB, CASSANDRA
